        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Piggy Food Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piggy Food Run</strong> is a challenging casual platformer for 1 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as a <strong>hungry pig</strong> that needs to race to the finish line to eat berries. The map is filled with various <strong>fruits</strong> that obstruct your path. If you fall, you must start over, however, there are <strong>mid-game checkpoints</strong> so you won't have to start from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with your friends, reach the goal, and enjoy the berries!</p>",
